<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of Aug 4.</p>
<p>				     Aug 04/Aug 01    Aug 04/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.07		 8.72</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.08		 6.96</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		15.00</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.14		56.00</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.94		41.97</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.99		42.67</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.07		19.12</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.18		35.81</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.01		52.53</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.07		51.10</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.24		35.25</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.04	     105.64</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,800,856,557,946</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  2,024,358,281,479</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,417,892,007,115</p>
<p>  International funds			   106,322,575,422</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    252,283,693,930</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
